window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Ghost girls just wanna have fun. </b><br> <br> When Reggie's former crushes show up as ghosts who want to have a good time, it's weird, but hey, why the hell not? It's all fun and games, haunting and experimenting with their new forms. <br> <br> But when they learn that their hit-and-run deaths might not have been an accident, they start looking for answers. They discover they were murdered, and have to find and stop the murderer before anyone else is hurt. <br> <br> What follows is a paranormal harem of ghostly proportions.</p> <p><i>A romance suspense for men that incorporates the quirky mystery of VERONICA MARS with the afterlife romance of GHOST.</i></p>"; 
